A '''cobblestone wall''' is a decorative [[wall]] variant of [[cobblestone]] that generates in Overworld [[structure]]s and is used for building.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Cobblestone walls can be mined using any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, they drop nothing.
{{Breaking row|Cobblestone Wall|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

=== Natural generation ===
Cobblestone walls generate in [[woodland mansion]]s. They also generate in [[pillager outpost]] towers, [[abandoned camp]]s, and in some houses in [[plains]], [[taiga]], and [[snowy tundra]] [[village]]s. They can also generate in [[snowy taiga]] villages {{in|be}}.

