== Trivia ==
*In [[1.17]], chiseled deepslate was spelled "Chiselled Deepslate", a departure from the normal US English spelling.
*Chiseled Deepslate is one of the few chiseled blocks that doesn't resemble a specific mob.<ref name=":0" />
**It does appear to resemble [[Dungeons II:Singer|singers]] or [[Dungeons II:Echo Golem|echo golems]] from [[Minecraft Dungeons II]], which were introduced later, and have direct connections to [[ancient city|ancient cities]], where chiseled deesplate is naturally found, through the {{MCD2|Deep Dark Portal}}. One possible explanation is that the singer's face was based on the chiseled deepslate face instead of the other way around.

